  "No starting section is posted; the Objective (ISB Operations / Empire's Sinister Agents, listed under Locations/Objective) and Prepared Defenses (listed under Interrupts) are the starting cards. No starting Effect is named, so starting.effect is left empty. Total 60 as published.",
  "Played at the 2001 Ohio State Championship: the post says the deck went undefeated in 3 games (beating WYS, Hidden Base Mains and EBO) and that without timed-out games it would have placed 3rd.",
  "The strategy says he forgot a grabber ('take out whatever you want and put a grabber in'); no grabber is in the posted list.",
  "Posted 'Mobilization Point' dested Mobilization Points (Death Star II); the You Cannot Hide Forever combo is Reflections III, after this post.",
  "Posted 'Secret Plans' dested the Special Edition Effect Secret Plans (not the later Defensive Shield).",
  "Posted 'We're In Attack Position Now - Admiral's Order' dested the Admiral's Order We're In Attack Position Now; 'Omni Box & It's Worse' dested Ommni Box & It's Worse.",
  "Posted Coruscant, Hoth, Kashyyyk, Sullust, Hoth Defensive Perimeter, Hoth Echo Docking Bay and Yavin 4 Docking Bay dested the Dark printings (Coruscant: the Special Edition Dark system).",
  "Lord Vader is posted x2 (a unique character); kept as published."
